{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25908","headline":"宴杨仆射新昌里第 · 杨汝士","name":"宴杨仆射新昌里第","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"隔坐应须赐御屏，尽将仙翰入高冥。\n文章旧价留鸾掖，桃李新阴在鲤庭。\n再岁生徒陈贺宴，一时良史尽传馨。\n当时疏广虽云盛，讵有兹筵醉绿醽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨汝士","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25908.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25908","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}